title: The Death of Hermann Müller
view-if: year = 1931 and month >= 3
frequency: 1000
max-visits: 1
tags: event
on-arrival: muller_dead = 1; n_advisors -= 1 if muller_advisor == 1; muller_advisor = 0; muller_died_in_office = 1 if chancellor = "Müller"; succession_muller = 1 if muller_advisor == 1 or chancellor == "Müller" or spd_coleader_1 == "Müller" or spd_coleader_2 == "Müller" or spd_coleader_3 == "Müller"

Herman Müller, one of the SPD's long-time leaders, has died. He will be greatly missed.

- @muller_chancellor_succession: We must decide his successor as Chancellor.
- @muller_vice_chancellor_succession: We must decide his successor as Chancellor.
- @muller_coleader_1_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @muller_coleader_2_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @muller_coleader_3_succession: We must decide his successor as Co-leader.
- @succession_concluded: We have dealt with all matters of succession.

@muller_chancellor_succession
view-if: chancellor == "Müller"
go-to: election_1928.chancellor_menu

Who should succeed Müller as Chancellor?

@muller_vice_chancellor_succession
view-if: chancellor == "Müller"
go-to: election_1928.vice_chancellor_menu

Who should succeed Müller as Vice-Chancellor?

@muller_coleader_1_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_1 == "Müller"
on-arrival: muller_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed Müller as Co-leader?

@muller_coleader_2_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_2 == "Müller"
on-arrival: muller_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed Müller as Co-leader?

@muller_coleader_3_succession
view-if: spd_coleader_3 == "Müller"
on-arrival: muller_advisor = 0; n_advisors -= 1
go-to: shuffle_leadership.add_advisors

Who should succeed Müller as Co-leader?

@succession_concluded
view-if: muller_advisor == 0 and chancellor != "Müller" and spd_coleader_1 != "Müller" and spd_coleader_2 != "Müller" and spd_coleader_3 != "Müller"
on-arrival: succession_muller = 0
